# Trance Kuja, Fate Defied: damage dealt by a Wizard you control is doubled - its own, the Wizard tokens' - and nothing else.
# Turns 1-5 as in the transform scenario: three Wizard tokens and, at the turn 5 end step, Trance Kuja (4/6). Turn 6 Bot2's
# Prodigal Sorcerer (a Wizard Bot2 controls) pings Bot1 for 1: not doubled (20 -> 19). Turn 7 Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt: each of the
# three Wizard tokens deals 1 doubled to 2 (6), the Bolt (not a Wizard) deals 3, Bot2 20 -> 11. Trance Kuja then attacks for 4,
# doubled to 8: Bot2 is at 3.

